(text "Raw logic is inverted: external HIGH turns Q on and reads LOW at the expander.\nApproximate switching region is around 2 V and varies with transistor and temperature.\nTarget input levels above are design limits to validate on hardware, not precision comparator thresholds.\nInput load at 12 V is approximately 0.24 mA/channel. Negative inputs are outside normal operation.\nDo not drive external pins above selected VIO; output-stage body diodes remain present in input mode." (at 20 232 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top) ) (uuid "b0224ec4-c7bb-46ec-b5d3-7d7710755d14")) (embedded_fonts no))
